digraph account_payable_process_57 {
	graph [rankdir=LR]
	START_NODE [label="" shape=circle width=0.3]
	subgraph CLUSTER_0 {
		"send to the receiving department" [shape=box]
		"create a receiving report" [shape=box]
		"send to the receiving department" -> "create a receiving report"
		"double check a three-way match" [shape=box]
		"create a receiving report" -> "double check a three-way match"
		"AND_SPLIT--4. Payment_500E" [label="+" fixedsize=true shape=diamond width=0.5]
		"double check a three-way match" -> "AND_SPLIT--4. Payment_500E"
		"create voucher for the documents" [shape=box]
		"AND_SPLIT--4. Payment_500E" -> "create voucher for the documents"
		"store in paid invoice file" [shape=box]
		"AND_SPLIT--4. Payment_500E" -> "store in paid invoice file"
		"enter the invoice into the accounts payable account" [shape=box]
		"AND_SPLIT--4. Payment_500E" -> "enter the invoice into the accounts payable account"
		"AND_JOIN--4. Payment_500E" [label="+" fixedsize=true shape=diamond width=0.5]
		"create voucher for the documents" -> "AND_JOIN--4. Payment_500E"
		"store in paid invoice file" -> "AND_JOIN--4. Payment_500E"
		"enter the invoice into the accounts payable account" -> "AND_JOIN--4. Payment_500E"
	}
	START_NODE -> "send to the receiving department"
	END_NODE [label="" shape=doublecircle width=0.2]
	"AND_JOIN--4. Payment_500E" -> END_NODE
	fontsize=15 label="\n\n
The following description is about the account payable process. It begins when you send to the receiving department. 
After sending to the receiving department, creating a receiving report should be done. 
After creating a receiving report, doubling check a three-way match needs to be done. 
When doubling check a three-way match is completed, the process is split into 3 parallel branches: creating voucher for the documents, storing in paid invoice file and entering the invoice into the accounts payable account. 
The process is now completed. 
"
	fontsize=15 label="\n\n
The following description is about the account payable process, which begins when you send to the receiving department.
After sending to the receiving department, a receiving report should be created.
After creating a receiving report, a three-way match must be checked.
When a three-way match is completed during the double check the process is split into 3 parallel branches : creating a voucher for the documents, storing in the paid invoice file and entering the invoice into the accounts payable account.
The process is now completed.
"
}
